	optdepends = playerctl: Media playback keybindings.
	optdepends = brightnessctl: Brightness media-key fallback.
	optdepends = gnome-keyring: Secrets keyring session component.
	optdepends = networkmanager: Network integration used by shell modules.
	optdepends = imagemagick: Wallpaper profiling and image processing.
	optdepends = mpvpaper: Video wallpaper playback.
	optdepends = kitty: Preferred terminal and Kitty theme synchronization.
	optdepends = xdg-utils: Open URLs/files from shell modules and keybindings.
	optdepends = xdg-user-dirs: Resolve user Pictures/Screenshots paths.
	optdepends = procps-ng: Process probing and fallback process control.
